<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆκ-τρον</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾶκτρον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything to strike
				with</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>instrument for striking the lyre, plectrum,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσέου ὑπὸ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					185
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				351
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράτινα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					795a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π . . . ξύλινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1388.80
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρούειν τῷ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					209b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐς λύρην ῥάψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					6.51
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήκτρῳ . . πληγῶν γιγνομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					531
				</span></i>
			 b. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spear-point,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορὸς διχόστομον π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					152
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόβολον π.,</span> of
			lightning, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				129
			</span></i> (lyr.); a bee's <i>sting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.90a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cock's spur,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				759
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1365
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				504b7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				694a13
			</span></i>; also, <i>spur</i> of crayfish, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					526a5
				</span></i>
			; <i>an analogous bone of the ankle,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				516b2
			</span></i>; <i>part of the thigh-joint,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδάλιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				143
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>goad,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				766
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.104
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
